(6928260, 1044280, 152252, '<td valign="top">I love it. First of all the way you cropped it is interesting. Second, the addition of golden necklace to a peaceful, grayish image is a great accent. 9</td>', 'I love it. First of all the way you cropped it is interesting. Second, the addition of golden necklace to a peaceful, grayish image is a great accent. 9', '2012-12-09 14:32:13.000000', NULL, 1),
