(6928286, 1044362, 152252, '<td valign="top">There is something really cool to that picture. First you made it much more interesting with the sign being backwards. Is the ghost like person under the sign one of the neon mothers? Maybe. Great b&amp;w. Love the way the pavement looks. Well done. 9</td>', 'There is something really cool to that picture. First you made it much more interesting with the sign being backwards. Is the ghost like person under the sign one of the neon mothers? Maybe. Great b&w. Love the way the pavement looks. Well done. 9', '2012-12-09 14:40:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6928296, 1044379, 152252, '<td valign="top">Great choice of tones for the subject. The old pot that really looks like Aladdin''s lamp is lovely. Looks really nice with the window in the background and the good lighting. The only thing that''s bothering me a little is that the tip of the teapot is so close to the picture edge. Wish you left maybe 2-3 more millimeters on the left side. Overall love it. 8</td>', 'Great choice of tones for the subject. The old pot that really looks like Aladdin''s lamp is lovely. Looks really nice with the window in the background and the good lighting. The only thing that''s bothering me a little is that the tip of the teapot is so close to the picture edge. Wish you left maybe 2-3 more millimeters on the left side. Overall love it. 8', '2012-12-09 14:46:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6928297, 1044263, 152252, '<td valign="top">The clouds are definitely spectacular. Great in b&amp;w. Voted earlier.</td>', 'The clouds are definitely spectacular. Great in b&w. Voted earlier.', '2012-12-09 14:47:58.000000', NULL, 1),
