(6931022, 1044294, 141319, '<td valign="top">I love this image. However, for me the image is not about water. Its about the beach and the boat and the clouds (OK, so perhaps the clouds are also water :-). For this challenge I think a picture of a crashing wave for example would have been more suitable. Again, the image is gorgeous, just don''t think it fits the challenge (my opinion only of course).</td>', 'I love this image. However, for me the image is not about water. Its about the beach and the boat and the clouds (OK, so perhaps the clouds are also water :-). For this challenge I think a picture of a crashing wave for example would have been more suitable. Again, the image is gorgeous, just don''t think it fits the challenge (my opinion only of course).', '2012-12-12 15:06:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6931028, 1044235, 141319, '<td valign="top">Great. I wonder if I would have preferred for the diamond to lie on the classical 1/3 line (cropping some of the bottom off. I do like the green on top vs the brown at the bottom. and the very shallow DOF with the "sand" - very nice</td>', 'Great. I wonder if I would have preferred for the diamond to lie on the classical 1/3 line (cropping some of the bottom off. I do like the green on top vs the brown at the bottom. and the very shallow DOF with the "sand" - very nice', '2012-12-12 15:11:07.000000', NULL, 1),
