(6933207, 1044373, 119863, '<td valign="top">ice job capturing the intricate detail in that piece.  I can almost imagine it being hundreds of yards tall like the face of a glacier.  Great choice of element as well, did you have to be careful not to melt the sample while handling it?</td>', 'ice job capturing the intricate detail in that piece.  I can almost imagine it being hundreds of yards tall like the face of a glacier.  Great choice of element as well, did you have to be careful not to melt the sample while handling it?', '2012-12-15 03:38:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(6938484, 1044382, 135697, '<td valign="top">thanks everyone for comments, as per my other challenges, trying to keep my processing if at all down to the minimum with maximum effect and still retain what i wanted to express, this is me actually trying to do the impression of someone in amazement of the fact of the simple truth of what we are all made from... and yet how complex and creative we humans can be and do when we use it positively :O)<br/> <br/>i shot this with in one go and with my new 85mm f/1.8 which has been its only outing out of its box so far, still itching to use it more... it was on self timer and different from other stuff ive done, and glad you enjoyed its subtlety throughout, thanks for that! :O)</td>', 'thanks everyone for comments, as per my other challenges, trying to keep my processing if at all down to the minimum with maximum effect and still retain what i wanted to express, this is me actually trying to do the impression of someone in amazement of the fact of the simple truth of what we are all made from... and yet how complex and creative we humans can be and do when we use it positively :O) i shot this with in one go and with my new 85mm f/1.8 which has been its only outing out of its box so far, still itching to use it more... it was on self timer and different from other stuff ive done, and glad you enjoyed its subtlety throughout, thanks for that! :O)', '2012-12-20 21:39:52.000000', NULL, 0),
